<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>System Behavior &amp; Validation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Landing Page Filters</strong>: Admin can filter templates by <st=
rong>Category</strong>, <strong>Language </strong>and <strong>Difficulty Le=
vel</strong>. The system ensures that the templates displayed match the sel=
ected criteria.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Preview</strong>: Admin can preview the template, which shows a =
fully functional representation of the selected landing page.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Template Selection</strong>: Admin must click <strong>Select</st=
rong> to confirm the landing page template. The system ensures only one val=
id template can be selected at a time.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Security Handling</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Data Integrity</strong>: All landing page selections and preview=
s are stored securely. Only authorized Admins can modify landing page templ=
ates.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit Logs</strong>: The system logs all actions related to temp=
late selection and filtering for audit purposes.</p></li>
</ul>
